<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>MEDICINE DETECTOR 100</title>
<style>body{text-align:center;font-family:Arial;background:#e0f7fa;padding:20px}h1{font-size:32px}h2{font-size:23px}.box{background:white;padding:15px;border-radius:15px;margin:10px}button{font-size:18px;padding:10px;margin:4px;border:none;border-radius:12px;background:#00b894;color:white}input{font-size:20px;padding:10px;width:85%} .sym{background:#0984e3} .all{background:#6c5ce7}</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>💊 MEDICINE DETECTOR - 100 💊</h1>
<p><b>Banaya hai: TUNE! 😎 Ab 100 Dawaiyan!</b></p>

<div class="box">
<h2>🔍 Naam likh ke pata karo!</h2>
<input id="name" placeholder="100 me se koi bhi... Crocin, Betadine..." oninput="find()">
<br><br><button onclick="find()">PATA KARO!</button>
<h2 id="result1">Yaha jawab aayega!</h2>
<p id="count">Total: 100 Dawaiyan!</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>🤒 Kya hua hai? TAP karo!</h2>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('bukhar')">🤒 Bukhar</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('sar')">😣 Sar Dard</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('sardi')">🤧 Sardi</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('khansi')">😮‍💨 Khansi</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('pet')">😖 Pet / Gas</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('chot')">🩹 Chot</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('loose')">💧 Loose Motion</button>
<button class="sym" onclick="show('vitamin')">💪 Vitamin</button>
<h2 id="result2">Yaha dawai ka naam aayega!</h2>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>📋 Sab 100 Dawaiyan - TAP karo!</h2>
<div id="allbtn"></div>
</div>
<p><b>⚠️ Ye sirf jaankari ke liye hai! Dawai khane se pehle Doctor / Mummy-Papa se pucho!</b></p>

